     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The wsdl that's used needs to be the wsdl?API-A  (the other one is generated by axis and is bad – will update docs to reflect that).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We need to try to reproduce this and find out what the problem is...",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
