      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The WSDL has been fixed in trunk and will go out with the 3.3 release.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Although the original error reported does not match the error I was seeing with .NET SDK 3.5, they both relate to FieldSearch, whose WSDL has historically been problematic with .NET.  it may be worth trying this fix with the older version of .NET if you're stuck using it, but I can at least confirm that it now works with .NET 3.5.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
